{"suttaId":"vv25","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Vv","vriCode":"s0506m.mul","paras":[794,822],"vripara":"246"},"segments":{"vv25:0.4":"Niddāvimānavatthu","vv25:1.1":"“Abhikkantena vaṇṇena, yā tvaṃ tiṭṭhasi devate;","vv25:1.3":"Obhāsentī disā sabbā, osadhī viya tārakā.","vv25:2.1":"“Kena tetādiso vaṇṇo … pe …","vv25:2.3":"Vaṇṇo ca te sabbadisā pabhāsatī”ti.","vv25:3.1":"Sā devatā attamanā … pe … yassa kammassidaṃ phalaṃ.","vv25:4.1":"“Niddāti [saddhāti (sī.)] mamaṃ aññaṃsu, rājagahasmiṃ upāsikā;","vv25:4.3":"Saddhā sīlena sampannā, saṃvibhāgaratā sadā.","vv25:5.1":"“Acchādanañca bhattañca, senāsanaṃ padīpiyaṃ;","vv25:5.3":"Adāsiṃ ujubhūtesu, vippasannena cetasā.","vv25:6.1":"“Cātuddasiṃ pañcadasiṃ, yā ca pakkhassa aṭṭhamī;","vv25:6.3":"Pāṭihāriyapakkhañca, aṭṭhaṅgasusamāgataṃ.","vv25:7.1":"“Uposathaṃ upavasissaṃ, sadā sīlesu saṃvutā;","vv25:7.3":"Saññamā saṃvibhāgā ca, vimānaṃ āvasāmahaṃ.","vv25:8.1":"“Pāṇātipātā viratā, musāvādā ca saññatā;","vv25:8.3":"Theyyā ca aticārā ca, majjapānā ca ārakā.","vv25:9.1":"“Pañcasikkhāpade ratā, ariyasaccāna kovidā;","vv25:9.3":"Upāsikā cakkhumato, gotamassa yasassino.","vv25:10.1":"“Tena metādiso vaṇṇo … pe … vaṇṇo ca me sabbadisā pabhāsatī”ti.","vv25:11.1":"Niddāvimānaṃ [saddhāvimānaṃ (sī.)] aṭṭhamaṃ."},"attha":null,"tika":null}
